#: ../xdg/com.github.BruskelProject.Bruskel.metainfo.xml.in.h:1
msgid ""
"Bruskel is a image editing, drawing and painting application with a simple yet "
"powerful interface. Bruskel has a wide range of drawing tools, including: "
"freehand, rectangles, circles and lines. It also has over 35 effects to "
"apply to your images, and also has the ability to create unlimited layers to "
"help organize your creativity."
msgstr ""
"Is feidhmchlár eagarthóireachta íomhánna, líníochta agus péintéireachta é "
"Bruskel le comhéadan simplí ach cumhachtach. Tá réimse leathan uirlisí "
"líníochta ag Bruskel, lena n-áirítear: saorláimhe, dronuilleoga, ciorcail agus "
"línte. Tá breis is 35 éifeacht aige le cur i bhfeidhm ar d’íomhánna, agus tá "
"an cumas aige sraitheanna gan teorainn a chruthú chun cabhrú le do "
"chruthaitheacht a eagrú."

